      },
      "text": "Viva Colombia"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:body:47f6c11f40afc686",
      "field": "body",
      "sourceTextSha256": "799e0ddcdb342a1ad12fb8863ce23a917cdaf9193f43a853913e5101e4d75711",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9la9dr-5gsd40eg",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "\n\nColombia brings together Andean, Caribbean and Amazonian cultures. In Bogotá, you’ll visit La Candelaria, with its colonial buildings, churches and narrow streets. In Medellín, the itinerary takes you from traditional museums and Botero Plaza to Comuna 13. Then come the landscapes of the coffee region: the wax palms of the Cocora Valley, Salento and the Venecia plantation. Your journey ends on the Caribbean coast in Cartagena’s walled old town.\n\n"
    }
  ]
